itical Hit Damage / 6% - 12%' 'Gear Named + Exotics!J93') #(minor3 'Mod Slot' 'Gear Named + Exotics!K93') #(flavour 'With Me.' 'Gear Named + Exotics!N93'))) #('Tardigrade Armor System' 'Chest' exotic nil #(#(slot 'Chest' 'Gear Named + Exotics!A89') #(name 'Tardigrade  / Armor System' 'Gear Named + Exotics!D96') #(talent 'Ablative Nano-Plating' 'Gear Named + Exotics!F95') #(description 'Whenever you or any ally''s armor breaks, they gain 80% of your armor as bonus armor for 10s. /  / Cooldown per ally: 45s /  / Killing an enemy with your specialization weapon removes this cooldown for all allies.' 'Gear Named + Exotics!G95') #(core 'Armour / 16,594 - 170.000' 'Gear Named + Exotics!H95') #(minor1 'Armor Regen / 1689 - 4925' 'Gear Named + Exotics!I95') #(minor2 'Explosive Resist / 1% - 10%' 'Gear Named + Exotics!J95') #(minor3 'Mod Slot' 'Gear Named + Exotics!K95') #(acquisition '- True Sons Bosses /  / -- Target loot / -- Exotic Caches' 'Gear Named + Exotics!M95') #(flavour 'An evolution of the reactive armour concept, ablative nano-plating was initially designed as a prototype technology for self-repairing heat shields on aircraft repeatedly entering and exiting planetary atmospheres. /  / - This is a science fiction version of ablative heat shielding, which is used primarily on spacecraft. The earliest description of this technology is / found in Robert H. Goddard''s 1920 letter to the Smithsonian Institution, hence the faction logo. Goddard pioneered much of the technology used in modern space / exploration, and a lot of his research was made possible through a grant from the Smithsonian Instiitution. / - In reality self-repairing materials exist, but ablative heat shields do not self-repair. Instead, they are made in a manner which allows them to sustain greatly  / decreased wear from atmospheric re-entry.' 'Gear Named + Exotics!N95'))) #('Ridgeway''s Pride' 'Chest' exotic nil #(#(slot 'Chest' 'Gear Named + Exotics!A89') #(name 'Ridgeway''s Pride' 'Gear Named + Exotics!D98') #(talent 'Bleeding Edge' 'Gear Named + Exotics!F97') #(description 'Shooting enemies within 15m applies bleed to the target. /  / Repair 3-48% of your armor per second for every enemy that is bleeding within 15m. /  / Repair strength per number of bleeding enemies: /  / 1:3% 2:6% 3:12% 4:24% 5:48%' 'Gear Named + Exotics!G97') #(core 'Weapon damage / 1.5% - 15%' 'Gear Named + Exotics!H97') #(minor1 'Critical Hit Chance / 1.2% - 6%' 'Gear Named + Exotics!I97') #(minor2 'Critical Hit Damage / 6% - 12%' 'Gear Named + Exotics!J97') #(minor3 'Mod Slot' 'Gear Named + Exotics!K97') #(acquisition '-The Summit project: / "Body Armor" floor 1-20 / "Shoulder Pads" floor 21-40 / "Hunting Knife" on floor 41-60 / "Flag Patch" floor 61-80 / "Dog Tags" floor 81-100 /  / After owning blueprint / -- Target loot / -- Exotic Caches' 'Gear Named + Exotics!M97') #(flavour '"You can tell a lot about a man by the way he bleeds. Me? I bleed for my country, and nothing else."  /  / - General Antwon Ridgeway' 'Gear Named + Exotics!N97'))))
