y closest to you within 20m. /  / Cooldown: 35s' 'Gear Named + Exotics!G113') #(core '>+1< / Skill tier' 'Gear Named + Exotics!H113') #(minor1 'Status Effects / 5% - 10%' 'Gear Named + Exotics!I113') #(minor2 'Hazard Protection / 5% - 10%' 'Gear Named + Exotics!J113') #(minor3 '----' 'Gear Named + Exotics!K113') #(acquisition '- Cleaners Bosses /  / -- Target loot / -- Exotic Caches' 'Gear Named + Exotics!M113') #(flavour '"Symbols are important. Look at the phoenix you wear on your sleeve. The dragon bears a similar significance to me."  / - Faye Lau /  / - SPOILERS AHEAD / - The Lau (or Liu) family was the ruling family of the Han Dynasty in ancient China. The ancient Chinese were deeply superstitious and the founder of the Han  / Dynasty, Liu Bang, claimed that he was conceived after his mother dreamt of a dragon. This was a clever move considering that in ancient China,  dragons were a  / symbol of imperial power and represented the Emperor.  / - The dragon bears a significance to Faye because just like the Han rebellion in ancient China, she believes that she will wipe out The Division take control.' 'Gear Named + Exotics!N113'))) #('Shocker Punch' 'Holster' exotic nil #(#(slot 'Holster' 'Gear Named + Exotics!A109') #(name 'Shocker Punch' 'Gear Named + Exotics!D116') #(talent 'Defibrillator' 'Gear Named + Exotics!F115') #(description 'While "Shocker Punch" is equipped, the stun received by the agent from the Shock status effect will be reduced by 50%. /  / Using a shield will give 100% to melee damage. /  / Using St. Elmo''s Engine with the holster will give 100% extra melee damage and will make the next melee attack apply shock to the target.  /  / Using all three items will offer all of the above mentioned bonuses and the Shock from the melee attack will have a 5m radius, starting from the first target.  /  / 15 second cooldown.' 'Gear Named + Exotics!G115') #(core 'Armour / 16,594 - 170.000' 'Gear Named + Exotics!H115') #(minor1 'Explosive Resist / 1% - 10%'